OL,3,GNEWSAMuch-loved lollipop lady retires
OL,4,Aafter 37 years
OL,5,
OL,6,FA much-loved lollipop lady who has been
OL,7,Fa "credit to the Middleton area" has
OL,8,Fretired after 37 years.
OL,10,FBarbara Gould started her career at St
OL,11,FThomas More Primary and St Michael's
OL,12,FPrimary School in Rochdale, where she
OL,13,Fwas also a lunchtime supervisor.
OL,15,FShe later moved to the crossing at
OL,16,FGrimshaw Lane, where she supported
OL,17,Fchildren from schools including
OL,18,FAlkrington Primary School and St
OL,19,FPeter's Primary School.
OL,23,APub: 11-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
